#before peer create 从栏上归档 {T} post:都弄好了 {T}
#before wait-chat 从栏上归档 {T}
# The chat's bar's 归档 (Chat.kt ChatBar, shown while nothing is left in the chat): Home at once, 已归档 said, the chat
# gone from the list; the station has it archived.
timeout 90000
until 从栏上归档 {T}
until 都弄好了 {T}
tap 从栏上归档 {T}
until icon:archive
wait 1500
shot 1-bar
tap icon:archive
until =已归档
gone 从栏上归档 {T}
shot 2-home
